msgid "Returns true if multi-value variable ``x`` contains exactly ``y`` as one of its values. Note that comparisons are case-sensitive."
msgstr ""
"如果多值变量 ``x`` 恰好包含 ``y`` 作为其值之一，则返回 true。请注意，比较是区"
"分大小写的。"

